  why example 1: F1 cycle 1 XMETA3 N>=3 seed Φ replication = 3 pods × ~$0.50 = $1.50 total. user-approval prompt for $1.50 dispatch wastes user attention on trivial decisions; agent can decide per cost-cap heuristic.
  why example 2: F5 cycle 1 ablation grid 4×3×3 = 36 cells × small forward = ~$5-10 total. Approval gate would force 36 separate prompts or 1 mega-prompt — both bad UX. Agent decides per ROI heuristic + raw 86 cost-attribution.
