  bans tree-report without gap-detection section (raw 95 triad-mandate visibility requirement — gaps MUST surface even when none detected, explicit 'GAPS: none' line)
  why anima own SSOT (12 entries) + hive raw SSOT (154 entries) growth (~165 active rules, ~5800 LoC combined) exceeds eyeball-scan threshold. Without structured ASCII visualization, governance refinement (which entry needs strengthening / which has weak connections / which violates raw 95 triad) requires manual grep-walk per entry → wallclock prohibitive + omission risk. Tree-report = 육안 단위 governance scan substrate. Strength + connection metrics make 'where to invest next' immediately visible. Gap detection enforces raw 95 triad-mandate as a passive surveillance layer (not blocking, but constantly visible).
