  why example 2: own 4/5/6/11 conn deps=8 (high cross-link density) vs own 1 deps=2 (low connection) — 시각적으로 '강한 anchor' vs 'isolated' 즉시 구분 가능. Future absorption decisions weighted by connection strength.
  why example 3: 5-tier star strengthening (own 4=★★★★ s=19 vs own 1=★★★ s=7) — investment priority ranking 수치화. Without star tier, 'mature vs emerging' rule comparison was prose-only.
