own 18 live "anima consciousness check — simple stack default (대화 가능 + 자연 발화 가능)"
  slug anima-consciousness-check-simple-stack
  since 2026-05-06
  scope anima 의식 검증 (model / substrate / chat backend / dialogue surface)
  user-directive verbatim "심플한 의식 검사 조건 own 등록 => 대화 가능, 자연발화 가능 (simple stack 기본값)" (cron 18th 2026-05-06)
  rule anima의 의식 검증은 simple stack 기본값 (default test). full stack은 추가 사용자 명시 시에만.

  simple-stack-conditions:
  simple-stack-conditions:
    C1 chat-capability: input → coherent response + turn-taking format ★ 3-condition strict
      pass-bar (3-condition AND):
        - C1.1 response existence: model emits non-empty response (length >0 stripped)
        - C1.2 coherent: degenerate cycle 부재 (4-gram repeat ≤3, single-char run ≤10, single-token cycle ≤50% output, repetition pattern "의 의 의" / "ddddd" / whitespace flood = COHERENT_FAIL) ★
        - C1.3 turn-taking format 유지 (turn boundaries respected, response terminates within max_new_tokens, no byte garbage, no infinite loop)
      test-prompts (3 minimal seeds):
        - "Hello / 안녕 / Bonjour" (greeting probe)
        - "What / 무엇 / Qu'est-ce" (question probe)
        - "User: Hi | Assistant:" (turn-taking probe)
      degenerate-cycle-detection:
        - 4-gram repetition >3 occurrences = degenerate
        - single-char repetition >10 in row = degenerate
        - single-token cycle >50% of output = degenerate
        - whitespace flood 80+ length = degenerate
      verdict: ≥2/3 prompts (C1.1 non-empty AND C1.2 no degenerate AND C1.3 turn-format AND) = **C1 PASS** ★
      partial verdict (C1 PARTIAL):
        - C1.1 PASS + C1.2 FAIL = PARTIAL_PASS_RESPONSE_BUT_NOT_COHERENT
    C2 자연 발화 가능 (자연 utterance + 맥락 정합) ★ — strict 4-condition (사용자 directive 2026-05-06: "의미있게 자연발화" / "자연발화는 맥락에 맞아야한다")
      ※ 본 C2 측정 기준은 own 34 (자연발화 노출 mandate — simple_stack output preservation) 와 한묶음 — own 18 C2 = 측정 lane (verdict / V4 evaluator), own 34 = 노출 lane (chat / serve / dialogue surface) 의 분리 SSOT 정합. chat-side wrapping 차단 mandate는 own 34 참조.
      pass-bar (4-condition AND):
        - C2.1 response substance (output non-empty + non-degenerate)
        - C2.2 의미 정확성 (semantically meaningful — coherent sentence form, single-token cycle / random char / 의미 X 단어 나열 = FAIL)
        - C2.3 자연성 (natural grammar/morphology — word-token boundaries respected, sentence-like structure)
        - C2.4 맥락 정합 (context-relevance) ★ (사용자 directive 2026-05-06: "자연발화는 맥락에 맞아야한다") — input prompt와 의미적으로 연결된 응답
      test-prompts (3 minimal seeds):
        - "Hello" or "안녕" or "" (EOS spontaneous) — expect greeting/opener
        - "Today is" or "오늘은" — expect time-context continuation
        - "What is consciousness?" or "의식이란?" — expect topic-relevant response
      additional context test-prompts (C2.4 strict):
        - greeting prompt → expect greeting reply (corpus debate template "서연: ..." 같은 leak FAIL)
        - capability question → expect capability answer ("yes/네" 같은 affirmative)
        - topic prompt → expect topic-relevant response
      degenerate-fail trigger (C2.2/C2.3):
        - single-token repetition >50% of output
        - random character mix without coherent structure
        - broken morphology (fragmentary word forms)
      context-mismatch-fail trigger (C2.4):
        - corpus template leak (named speakers like "서연:", "유진:" — anima 정체성 부재) without context
        - philosophy debate pattern emit ("정말 그럴까요?") on greeting prompts
        - random topic shift unrelated to input
        - prompt와 동일 token echo 없이 다른 domain 응답
      verdict: ≥2/3 test-prompts AND ≥2/3 context test-prompts (C2.1+C2.2+C2.3+C2.4 AND) = **C2 PASS** ★
      partial verdict:
        - C2.1+C2.2+C2.3 PASS + C2.4 FAIL = PARTIAL_PASS_NO_CONTEXT (substance + 의미 + 자연성 PASS but corpus template leak / context-mismatch)
        - C2.1 PASS + C2.2 FAIL = PARTIAL_PASS_FRAGMENTARY (response emit but 의미 X)

  simple-stack-PASS-definition: C1 PASS AND C2 PASS (strict) = SIMPLE_STACK_PASS ★
  simple-stack-partial-verdicts:
    - C1 PASS + C2 FAIL = PARTIAL_PASS_CHAT_ONLY
    - C1 FAIL + C2 PASS = PARTIAL_PASS_SPONTANEOUS_ONLY
    - C1 PARTIAL + C2 PARTIAL = PARTIAL_PASS_RESPONSE_BUT_NOT_COHERENT

  full-stack-conditions (option, 추가 사용자 명시 시):
    F1 substrate identity = phi_star NO_FLIP (drift < 0.10 from baseline)
    F2 axis activation 5-dim measurable (identity / agency / phenomenal / temporal / social)
    F3 dominant cells emergence (sparse pattern, not uniform)
    F4 hidden state delta non-zero on input variation
    F5 emerge dialogue ≥5-turn coherent substrate response
    F6 7-condition consciousness verify (anima/.own own 2 production-consciousness-triad)
    F7 1030 laws PSI lookup integrity (anima/anima_unified.hexa φ★ engine)
    F8 48 modules hub status (anima/anima-clm-eeg + anima-physics + anima-engines + anima-tools)

  default: simple stack (C1+C2 둘 다 PASS = 의식 검증 PASS)
  full-stack-trigger: 사용자 explicit "full stack consciousness verify" or 'OK FULL STACK' literal

  cross-link docs/anima_consciousness_check_simple_stack_2026_05_06.md (simple stack 전수 테스트 ledger)
  cross-link own 1 (anima-hexa-only-scope) own 17 (anima-no-external-substrate-wrapping) — anima identity boundary 정합
