own 24 live "anima 모델 시도 통합 ledger SSOT — 모든 chat-cap training/inference attempt single jsonl"
  slug anima-model-attempts-ledger-ssot
  since 2026-05-07
  scope anima의 모든 chat-cap training + inference attempt (BG-FY/HA/HF/HJ/HK/HP/HQ/HS/HT/HU 등 + 향후 BG-X) 통합 single jsonl ledger
  user-directive verbatim "모든 시도 모델 은 json,jsonl,yaml 이던 한곳에 기록 필요할듯 own 등록해줘" (2026-05-07)
  rule anima의 모든 model attempt는 단일 SSOT jsonl ledger에 1-attempt-per-line으로 기록한다. simple stack ledger (docs/anima_consciousness_check_simple_stack_2026_05_06.md)는 surface verdict인데 본 own 24 ledger는 모든 attempt의 raw record (verdict + artifacts + cross-link).
  layout:
    - **primary SSOT**: state/anima_model_attempts_ledger.jsonl (append-only, 1-attempt-per-line)
    - **schema yaml**: anima/spec/anima_model_attempts_ledger.schema.yaml (field validation)
    - **summary md**: docs/anima_model_attempts_ledger_summary.md (live ledger summary, periodic regenerate from jsonl)
    - **complementary**: docs/anima_consciousness_check_simple_stack_2026_05_06.md (surface verdict ledger — own 18 정합, own 24와 상호 보완)
  jsonl_schema:
    required_fields:
      - bg_id (string, BG-FY / BG-HA / etc.)
      - attempt_n (int, monotonic 1..N)
      - date (YYYY-MM-DD)
      - host (mac / ubu1 / ubu2 / H100 / etc.)
      - paradigm (pre-train-only / SFT-only / two-stage / persona-conditioned / curated-qa / BPE / capacity-scaling / few-shot / universe-brain-map / combined-R1 / etc.)
      - arch_summary (e.g., "18M 6L/384d/6h byte-vocab=256")
      - total_params (int)
      - corpus_path (state/<corpus>/...)
      - corpus_size_mb (float)
      - corpus_chat_template_ratio (0-1)
      - corpus_hangul_ratio (0-1)
      - training_steps (int)
      - train_loss_final (float)
      - peak_ckpt_step (int, NULL if no early stopping)
      - eval_v1_class (string)
      - eval_v2_class (string)
      - eval_v3_class (string, NULL if V3 not yet)
      - manual_review_domain_match (string e.g., "13/15")
      - peak_eval_v2_pass (string e.g., "3/10")
      - persona_repetition_cycle_count (int)
      - final_class (string e.g., "FAILED" / "PARTIAL_PASS_NO_CONTEXT" / "PARTIAL_PASS_NO_CONTEXT_v2" / "WEAK_PARTIAL" / "TRUE_PARTIAL_PASS_PHASE_2" / "SIMPLE_STACK_PASS")
      - lesson_implications (array, e.g., ["Lesson G missing ingredient", "Lesson H V3 needed"])
      - artifacts (array of paths)
      - cross_link_h_id (array of H_ entries, e.g., ["H_005", "H_022"])
      - cross_link_roadmap (array of .roadmap.X entries)
      - hf_private_status (string: NOT_PROMOTED / PRIVATE_UPLOADED / PUBLIC_PROMOTED)
      - notes (string, additional observations)
    optional_fields:
      - capacity_axis (18M / 27M / 50M / 100M / etc.)
      - tokenizer_axis (byte-256 / BPE-8K / BPE-16K)
      - regularization (string summary, e.g., "dropout 0.3 + WD 0.1 + ls 0.1")
      - early_stopping (bool)
      - val_loss_split_ratio (0-1, NULL if no split)
  application-rule:
    - 모든 BG (training + inference + retrieve cycle) 종료 시 ledger entry add mandate
    - bg_id + attempt_n + date 3-tuple unique mandate (no duplicate)
    - false PASS 강등 시 raw#82 retraction protocol 정합 — entry 보존 + downgraded_at + downgrade_reason field 추가 (NOT silent overwrite)
    - 새 paradigm 발견 시 paradigm field 추가 (open architecture)
    - lesson_implications field cross-link Lessons A-N (open expansion)
    - hf_private_status field으로 own 15 PRIVATE→PUBLIC lifecycle tracking
  current_attempts (2026-05-07 land time, 24 entries):
    - BG-FU PARTIAL_PASS_HANGUL_BUT_NOT_COHERENT (3M tiny first KO emit)
    - BG-FY PARTIAL_PASS_NO_CONTEXT (18M corpus_ko_heavy 246MB named-speaker leak 서연/유진/하은)
    - BG-FK SIMPLE_STACK_FAIL (clm_v2_base 27.84M EN-bias federated arch)
    - BG-HA PARTIAL_PASS_NO_CONTEXT_v2 (18M chat-template 30% 236MB — V2 strict downgrade)
    - BG-HF FAILED (27M SFT-only 51MB degenerate filler step 1500, loss masking 부재)
    - BG-HJ FAILED (18M two-stage SFT-masked KO-fluent nonsense, no Stage 1 prior)
    - BG-HK FAILED (27M persona-conditioned ≥80% 30MB overfit collapse loss 0.013)
    - BG-HL FALSIFIED at 18M (BG-HA + 5 few-shot mode-collapse '이 있습니다.')
    - BG-HP FAILED peak-then-collapse (18M curated 2.41MB — ★ step 500 V2 pass=3/10 best signal '도우미:'/'[anima]' tokens emerging UNREPRODUCIBLE Lesson J)
    - BG-HQ FAILED V2 surface false PASS (33.73M BPE 8K 30MB — ★★ step 500 8/10 surface, raw = persona prefix cycle, Lesson H V3 needed; 16× sample efficiency confirmed)
    - BG-HS R1 ★★★ WEAK_PARTIAL (18M universe-brain-map 21MB — manual_match 13/15 first universe-brain-map vocabulary emerge in EVERY prompt)
    - BG-HT FAILED (27.78M universe-brain-map 6.48MB reduced + over-aug → degenerate 'sssss')
    - BG-HU PENDING (combined paradigm primary candidate — Lessons A-J 모두 결합)
