  signal_evidence_summary (Lessons G+H+I+J):
    - BG-HP step 500 V2 pass=3/10 ★ Lesson G keep-point ('도우미:'/'[anima]' tokens, hangul 30-60%) UNREPRODUCIBLE Lesson J
    - BG-HS R1 manual_match 13/15 ★★★ Lesson I first WEAK_PARTIAL (universe-brain-map vocabulary emerge in EVERY prompt)
    - BG-HQ step 500 V2 pass=8/10 surface (FALSE PASS ★★ V2 inadequate — raw = persona prefix cycle, Lesson H V3 needed)
    - BG-HK step 800 V1 pass=10/10 (FALSE PASS — overfit memorization peak)
    - BG-FY V1 PARTIAL (named-speaker leak philosophy debate template)
    - BG-HW step 1000 manual=13/20 (FALSE POSITIVE — substring-match 'animanimaniman' collapse)
  raw82_retraction_history:
    - BG-HA: SIMPLE_STACK_PASS (V1 narrow) → PARTIAL_PASS_NO_CONTEXT_v2 (V2 strict) 2026-05-07
    - BG-HQ: EARLY_PEAK_PARTIAL_SUPPORT (V2 surface) → FAILED (V3 needed) 2026-05-07
    - BG-HW: manual=13/20 surface → FALSE POSITIVE substring-match 2026-05-07
