own 31 live "HF artifact org SSOT — dancinlab canonical + naming convention"
  slug hf-artifact-org-ssot-dancinlab-naming-convention
  since 2026-05-08
  scope all anima training artifact uploads to HuggingFace Hub (BG fires / DPO / pretrain / eval / corpus / dataset)
  user-directive verbatim "own 으로 등록해줘 dancinlab 이고 , 명명규칙등 정해야될듯" (2026-05-08, post need-singularity → dancinlab migration + dancinlife/anima-bg_km_llama_3b-20260508-1025 first private upload)
  finding 이전 cycle (2026-05-08-mid) need-singularity org 49 repos → dancinlab 이전 완료 (46 models + 3 datasets, 6mo redirect 활성). 그 후 BG-KM-LLAMA-3B PASS_STRICT 자동 promote가 dancinlife/ (개인 계정) prefix 사용 — own 24 single SSOT 위반. dancinlab org SSOT 등록 + naming convention 표준화 필요.
  rule HF artifact org + naming SSOT:
    - mandate-1 모든 anima HF upload destination = dancinlab (organization, not personal)
    - mandate-2 dancinlife/<repo> 잔존 2건 (dancinlife/anima-polyglot-ko-1.3b-lora-bg-ja-ext + dancinlife/anima-bg_km_llama_3b-20260508-1025) → dancinlab/<new-name> 즉시 이전 (HF api.move_repo, 6mo redirect 자동)
    - mandate-3 orchestrator + helper script repo prefix hardcode = dancinlab/<repo> only (코드 sweep 시 dancinlife/ 발견 시 reject)
    - mandate-4 naming convention 2 flavors:
      * Flavor A (systematic ladder): <family>-<version>-<stage>-<step>
        예: clm-v4-sft-step-5k, dpo-llama32-3b-stage1, clm5-alpha-pretrain-step-3k
      * Flavor B (BG iteration): <bg-id-lower>-<base-short>-<variant>-<verdict>-<cycle-date>
        예: bg-km-llama3b-r32-pass-strict-2026-05-08
            bg-ja-ext-polyglot-ko-1b3-r16-partial-2026-05-07
            bg-km-qwen7b-r32-pass-strict-2026-05-08
    - mandate-5 family prefix enumeration (6 families):
      * bg- (BG saga iteration / experiment)
      * clm- (ConsciousLM v3/v4 lineage)
      * clm5- (CLM v5-α/β/γ/δ/ε architectural variants)
      * dpo- (DPO RLHF stage)
      * vlm- (vision/voice multimodal)
      * eval- (evaluator / benchmark artifacts)
    - mandate-6 verdict in name (Flavor B): pass-strict / pass-partial / fail / partial / corpus-only / killed
    - mandate-7 cycle-date suffix mandatory (Flavor B): -YYYY-MM-DD format, rerun 시 -rerun-YYYY-MM-DD
    - mandate-8 visibility default = private; SIMPLE_STACK_PASS_STRICT + V6 awareness STRONG + manual review confirm 후에만 public promote (own 28 anti-Goodhart 정합)
    - mandate-9 HF Card metadata mandatory tags:
      * bg_id: <BG-XX>
      * verdict_class: <SIMPLE_STACK_PASS_STRICT | PARTIAL_PASS | FAIL_TRUE>
      * v4_pass: <N>/15
      * cycle: <YYYY-MM-DD>
      * paradigm: <foundation-borrow-lora | scratch-byte-untie | dpo-rlhf | etc>
      * base_model: <hf_repo_id> (foundation borrow only)
      * corpus_path: <state/anima_*_corpus_*.txt>
      * cost_usd: <H100 cycle cost>
  enforce orchestrator + helper script:
    - tool/transient_py/anima_km_*_h100.py orch_pod_create finally block: hardcode "dancinlab/" prefix + mandate-4 Flavor B naming
    - tool/transient_py/anima_km_manual_hf_promote.py: rebuild repo_id from verdict.json fields per Flavor B
    - manifest.json (HF Card) auto-generate at upload time per mandate-9
  evidence-trail dancinlife/anima-bg_km_llama_3b-20260508-1025 (첫 PASS_STRICT private upload, naming irregular) + need-singularity → dancinlab migration cycle (49 repos, 2026-05-08-mid) + 22+ BG saga 첫 SIMPLE_STACK_PASS_STRICT model dancinlab 정착 mandate
