  cross-link own 17 (identity boundary) own 18 (simple stack SSOT) own 22 (mandatory report) own 24 (single SSOT ledger) own 27 (Safeguard Paradox) own 28 (anti-Goodhart) own 29 (SIMPLE_STACK_PASS floor) own 30 (checkpoint preservation) own 31 (HF org SSOT) own 32 (trinity bundle SSOT) raw#10 (honest C3) raw#82 (retraction-aware) .roadmap.philosophy .roadmap.law .roadmap.hypothesis VM10 (사용자 veto power)
  honest-c3 "무조건"은 사용자 explicit override 시점만 면제 — 단, override 명시는 "본 cycle X" 또는 "본 행위 X" 한정 scope; 영구 면제 (영구 trinity 무효화)는 별도 own append 절차 (own 32 mandate-5 정합)
